---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Request a quote
metaTitle: "Request a Quote | Acurris Analytical"
description: "Request pricing, lead time and spec sheets for rapid food safety test kits and sample preparation products. Reply within 48 hours."
pageType: rfq
hideSticky: true
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Request a quote
---
{%- import "partials/forms.njk" as forms with context %}
<section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:var(--space-xl)">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <h1>Request a quote</h1>
    <p class="lead">Start with four details. We reply within {{ site.supportHours }} hours with pricing, lead time, a spec sheet and a recommendation if more than one product fits.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" style="padding-top:var(--space-xl)">
  <div class="container split split--wide-left">
    {{ forms.rfq("quote", "", "Your requirement") }}
    <aside>
      <div class="callout" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-lg)">{% icon "clock" %}<div><h2 class="h3" style="font-size:1.0625rem">What happens next</h2><p>A technical team member reads your request, checks fit and stock, and replies by email or phone within {{ site.supportHours }} hours on working days.</p></div></div>
      <h2 class="h3">Prefer to write directly?</h2>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li>{% icon "mail" %}<a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" data-track="email_click">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
        {%- if site.phone %}<li>{% icon "phone" %}<a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" data-track="call_click">{{ site.phoneDisplay or site.phone }}</a></li>{% endif %}
        {%- if site.whatsapp %}<li>{% icon "message-circle" %}<a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}" data-track="whatsapp_click" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a></li>{% endif %}
        {%- if site.address.length %}<li>{% icon "map-pin" %}<span>{{ site.address | join(", ") }}</span></li>{% endif %}
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
